{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1PE","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"彼得前書","commonName":"彼得前書","title":"彼得前書","order":60,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"74106190c45ed44b3954e28c321f0dadcb75382430abb2fa615c39fddc5e7213","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1PE/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1PE/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["照管上帝的羊群"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我這作長老、作基督受苦的見證、同享後來所要顯現之榮耀的，勸你們中間與我同作長老的人："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["務要牧養在你們中間上帝的群羊，按着上帝旨意照管他們；不是出於勉強，乃是出於甘心；也不是因為貪財，乃是出於樂意；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["也不是轄制所託付你們的，乃是作群羊的榜樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["到了牧長顯現的時候，你們必得那永不衰殘的榮耀冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你們年幼的，也要順服年長的。就是你們眾人也都要以謙卑束腰，彼此順服；因為",{"text":"上帝阻擋驕傲的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜恩給謙卑的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以，你們要自卑，服在上帝大能的手下，到了時候，他必叫你們升高。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你們要將一切的憂慮卸給上帝，因為他顧念你們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["務要謹守，警醒。因為你們的仇敵魔鬼，如同吼叫的獅子，遍地遊行，尋找可吞吃的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你們要用堅固的信心抵擋他，因為知道你們在世上的眾弟兄也是經歷這樣的苦難。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那賜諸般恩典的上帝曾在基督裏召你們，得享他永遠的榮耀，等你們暫受苦難之後，必要親自成全你們，堅固你們，賜力量給你們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["願權能歸給他，直到永永遠遠。阿們！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["問安"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我略略地寫了這信，託我所看為忠心的兄弟西拉轉交你們，勸勉你們，又證明這恩是上帝的真恩。你們務要在這恩上站立得住。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["在巴比倫與你們同蒙揀選的教會問你們安。我兒子馬可也問你們安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你們要用愛心彼此親嘴問安。願平安歸與你們凡在基督裏的人！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1PE/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2PE/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1PE/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}